## Question

Which verified SAM/SAM3 mechanisms can connect independently established
perception detection and segmentation baselines, and what experiments separate
prompt quality, mask refinement, semantic recognition, geometry and distillation?

## Evidence

Primary-source review: experiments/waymo-perception/research/sam-integration-pathways.md.
Frozen predicted-box refinement is selected as the initial integration experiment; later distillation and joint architectures remain conditional.

User approved proceeding with the initial direction on 2026-09-30. Detailed mechanisms and broader scope are constrained by the linked experiment specification, not assumed settled.
